| | CRC_N | CRC Nord | 0.67 |
| | CRC_S | CRC Sud | 0.33 |

| bccs | id | name | crc_id | managed_load_mw | area_km2 |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| | BCC1 | BCC Tunis | CRC_N | 420 | 1200 |
| | BCC5 | BCC Sfax | CRC_S | 310 | 4800 |

| substations | id | name | bcc_id |
