|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| F-125 | SS-014 | BCC1 | P4 | false | 13.4 | Z-LAC-2 | 135 | 3 | 2026-09-18T21:50Z |
| F-201 | SS-014 | BCC1 | P0 | true | 8.0 | Z-HOSP-1 | 0 | 0 | null |
| F-310 | SS-020 | BCC2 | P2 | false | 9.7 | Z-ARI-1 | 60 | 1 | 2026-09-16T20:40Z |

